DTSTAMP:20261015T214244Z
DTSTART:20261228T173000
DTEND:20261228T174000
SUMMARY:Lab: Balancing Act
DESCRIPTION:"Can you balance a ruler on one finger? What if I make one en
 d heavy?"\n\nGrab:\n- a ruler or paint stirrer\n- a lump of play-dough\n
 - a pencil or marker\n\nhttps://timjfarrell.com/stem-lab/balance-point.h
 tml
URL:https://timjfarrell.com/stem-lab/balance-point.html
END:VEVENT
