DTSTART:20270104T173000
DTEND:20270104T174000
SUMMARY:Lab: Guess the Jar
DESCRIPTION:"How many blocks are in this jar? Don't count. Guess!"\n\nGra
 b:\n- a clear jar or bowl\n- 15 to 30 small things: blocks\, pom-poms\, 
 grapes\n\nhttps://timjfarrell.com/stem-lab/estimation.html
URL:https://timjfarrell.com/stem-lab/estimation.html
